Provides:
 xorgxrdp (= ${fastrdp:XorgxrdpVersion}),
 xrdp (= ${fastrdp:XrdpVersion}),
Description: xrdp and xorgxrdp as used by fastrdp (FFmpeg H.264 encoder)
 xrdp is an RDP server for X11 sessions; xorgxrdp is its Xorg driver.
 .
 This build replaces the distribution's xrdp and xorgxrdp packages. It
 carries the fastrdp patches (patches/xrdp in the fast-rdp-server sources:
 FFmpeg hardware H.264 encoder for VA-API, NVENC and QSV, falling back to
 x264) and is configured for fastrdp, where xrdp only listens on loopback
 behind the fastrdp proxy.
 .
 The services are installed disabled: configure /etc/xrdp (the fastrdp
 deployment roles do), then enable xrdp.service and xrdp-sesman.service.
